  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The 50km walk challenge : Help refugees in Lesvos</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">7 members of our community have set themselves the challenge of walking 50 km on the 29th of of April to raise money for the refugees of Yoga and Sports with Refugees in Lesvos, an NGO helping with physical and mental health of refugees through sport. Lesvos is a Greek island known for being a major arrival point for refugees. Yoga and Sport with Refugees addresses a crucial need for support, structure and community for people during the asylum process.</narrative>
  </description>
